github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106245#discussion_r2083226713","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106245","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2083226713"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106245#discussion_r2083226713"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106245"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2083226713/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1382,"original_line":1262,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2083226391,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":16,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2083560122","pull_request_review_id":2831435829,"id":2083560122,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc58MJq6","diff_hunk":"@@ -1261,7 +1259,7 @@ void Theme::get_type_list(List<StringName> *p_list) const {\n \t}\n \n \tfor (const StringName &E : types) {\n-\t\tp_list->push_back(E);\n+\t\tp_list.push_back(E);","path":"scene/resources/theme.cpp","commit_id":"12ee44a35463a51515635b44808b57b42a981b81","original_commit_id":"ae316545f93b5a44a62e670be9cde0f0e74b30e8","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Reserving space for a container that you don't fully control isn't always best practice. If the caller invokes this method multiple times, the `reserve` calls might lead to more memory allocations than the default x2 resizing, potentially turning the time complexity into O(n) (See [this video](https://youtu.be/algDLvbl1YY?si=YakvudfWhW6vUODl) for more info). Although we are not using this API in such a bad pattern, I tend to avoid using `reserve()` for externally passed containers so they will never be used badly. Instead, I prefer providing a separate function for concatenating containers, allowing the caller to perform the concatenation themselves after receiving all of them. This way, the memory allocation becomes explicit and easier to reason about.\r\n\r\nInstead of\r\n```C++\r\nLocalVector<StringName> vector;\r\ntheme1.get_type_list(vector);\r\ntheme2.get_type_list(vector);\r\ntheme3.get_type_list(vector);\r\n```\r\nI prefer\r\n```C++\r\nLocalVector<StringName> v1 = theme1.get_type_list();\r\nLocalVector<StringName> v2 = theme2.get_type_list();\r\nLocalVector<StringName> v3 = theme3.get_type_list();\r\nLocalVector<StringName> vector = concat(v1, v2, v3);\r\n```\r\n\r\nFor this specific case, I'd like to keep it as is because it is fast enough. I'm now trying to implement this concat function and will change this one accordingly in that PR.","created_at":"2025-05-11T15:52:49Z","updated_at":"2025-05-11T15:52:49Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106245#discussion_r2083560122","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106245","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2083560122"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106245#discussion_r2083560122"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106245"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2083560122/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1382,"original_line":1262,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2083226391,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":16,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]